  CVE-2026-7512|2026-05-01T00:16:25.257|2026-05-01T15:26:24.553|7.4|HIGH|CWE-119|N/A|false|A flaw has been found in UTT HiPER 1200GW up to 2.5.3-1703. The affected element is the function strcpy of the file /goform/formUser. Executing a manipulation can lead to buffer overflow. The attack can be launched remotely. The exploit has been published and may be used.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-7512|0.00041|0.12307|5.1812
